Imagine a football team.

⚽ Synaptic Plasticity

Players pass the ball more efficiently.

(The connections improve.)

⚽ Structural Plasticity

The team recruits new players and removes weak ones.

(The structure changes.)

⚽ Intrinsic Plasticity

Each player becomes stronger, faster, and more skilled.

(The neuron changes.)

⚽ Network Plasticity

The coach changes the entire formation.

(The whole network reorganizes.)

